{"text": "Keawe married Kokua and brought her to the Bright House, but the fear of the fire never left his heart. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He could not tell his secret to anyone, not even to the wife whom he loved more than his own life. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Kokua soon noticed his sadness, and one night she found him weeping alone in the dark. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When Keawe told her the whole story, she did not run away from him but promised to save him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She explained that the French used a coin called the centime, which was worth only one fifth of a cent. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On a French island, she said, we can sell the bottle for four centimes, then three, then two, then one. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So the couple sailed to Tahiti, a French island in the South Seas, and rented a house in the town of Papeete. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the people there soon heard about the devil in the bottle, and nobody wanted to come near them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Day after day they failed to sell it, and as their hope faded, Keawes heart grew darker and darker.", "alignment": {"characters": ["K", "e", "a", "w", "e", " ", "m", "a", "r", "r", "i", "e", "d", " ", "K", "o", "k", "u", "a", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "b", "r", "o", "u", "g", "h", "t", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "B", "r", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "H", "o", "u", "s", "e", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "e", "a", "r", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "i", "r", "e", " ", "n", "e", "v", "e", "r", " ", "l", "e", "f", "t", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "h", "e", "a", "r", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "c", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "t", "e", "l", "l", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "s", "e", "c", "r", "e", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a", "n", "y", "o", "n", "e", ",", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "e", "v", "e",